          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Easy access to the compiler API"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "TypeScript VFS lets you create a self-contained TypeScript environment entirely under your control. This library is used to power the Playground, and provides the underlying tooling for "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "/dev/twoslash/"
        },
